﻿<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Together AI &mdash; Design System</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        --black: #000;
        --dark: #010120;
        --soft: #313641;
        --body: #959494;
        --white: #fff;
        --orange: #fc4c02;
        --magenta: #ef2cc1;
        --peri: #bdbbff;
        --mint: #c8f6f9;
        --rail: linear-gradient(
          90deg,
          var(--orange),
          var(--magenta),
          var(--peri)
        );
      }
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: #fff;
        color: #000;
        font:
          16px/1.3 "The Future",
          Inter,
          "Helvetica Neue",
          Arial,
          sans-serif;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      }
      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      button {
        font: inherit;
      }
      :focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--magenta);
        outline-offset: 3px;
      }
      .wrap {
        width: min(100% - 40px, 1120px);
        margin: auto;
      }
      .nav {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 5;
        height: 64px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        background: var(--dark);
        color: #fff;
      }
      .nav .wrap,
      .nav-left,
      .links {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
      }
      .nav .wrap {
        justify-content: space-between;
      }
      .nav-left,
      .links {
        gap: 14px;
      }
      .brand {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .logo-favicon {
        width: 30px;
        height: 30px;
        object-fit: contain;
      }
      .links,
      .url,
      .tag {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #fff;
      }
      .links {
        gap: 18px;
      }
      .links a:hover,
      .url:hover {
        color: var(--mint);
      }
      .hero {
        padding: 88px 0;
        background: var(--dark);
        color: #fff;
      }
      .hero h1,
      h2,
      h3 {
        font-weight: 500;
      }
      .hero h1 {
        max-width: 780px;
        font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 64px);
        line-height: 1.1;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      }
      .hero p {
        max-width: 590px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }
      .rail {
        height: 8px;
        margin-top: 44px;
        background: var(--rail);
      }
      .buttons {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 32px;
      }
      .btn {
        padding: 10px 24px;
        border: 0;
        border-radius: 4px;
        background: #000;
        color: #fff;
        font:
          500 16px/1 "PP Neue Montreal Mono",
          ui-monospace,
          monospace;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .btn.mint {
        background: var(--mint);
        color: #000;
      }
      .site {
        padding-top: 80px;
      }
      section {
        padding: 80px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        scroll-margin-top: 64px;
      }
      .head {
        max-width: 670px;
        margin-bottom: 32px;
      }
      h2 {
        font-size: 40px;
        line-height: 1.2;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }
      .head p {
        margin-top: 12px;
        color: var(--body);
      }
      .swatches {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 8px;
      }
      .swatch {
        min-height: 128px;
        padding: 16px;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: end;
        border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        border-radius: 4px;
      }
      .swatch code,
      .spec {
        margin-top: 4px;
        font:
          10px/1.4 ui-monospace,
          monospace;
        letter-spacing: 0.05px;
        opacity: 0.75;
      }
      .type {
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }
      .row {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr 150px;
        gap: 16px;
        align-items: baseline;
        padding: 18px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }
      .role,
      .spec {
        color: var(--body);
      }
      .sample {
        font-weight: 500;
        line-height: 1.15;
      }
      .metrics {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
        gap: 48px;
        align-items: end;
      }
      .spacing {
        height: 160px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: end;
        gap: 8px;
      }
      .space {
        display: flex;
        flex: 1;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: end;
        gap: 6px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 11px;
        color: var(--body);
      }
      .bar {
        width: 100%;
        background: #000;
      }
      .radii {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 8px;
      }
      .radius {
        min-height: 78px;
        padding: 12px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: end;
        border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        font-size: 14px;
        color: var(--body);
      }
      .dark-card {
        padding: 24px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        background: var(--dark);
        color: #fff;
      }
      .code {
        margin-top: 16px;
        padding: 16px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        background: var(--soft);
        font:
          10px/1.6 ui-monospace,
          monospace;
      }
      .components,
      .guides {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 40px;
      }
      .title {
        font-size: 22px;
      }
      .note {
        margin-top: 12px;
        color: var(--body);
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .feature {
        padding: 24px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        border-radius: 4px;
      }
      .feature p,
      .guides ul {
        color: var(--body);
      }
      .guides ul {
        margin: 12px 0 0;
        padding-left: 20px;
      }
      .guides li + li {
        margin-top: 8px;
      }
      footer {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 20px;
        padding: 32px 0 64px;
        color: var(--body);
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      .downloads {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px;
      }
      .downloads a:hover {
        color: var(--magenta);
      }
      @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .wrap {
          width: min(100% - 28px, 1120px);
        }
        .links,
        .tag {
          display: none;
        }
        .hero,
        section,
        .site {
          padding-top: 56px;
          padding-bottom: 56px;
        }
        .swatches {
          grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        }
        .row {
          grid-template-columns: 82px 1fr;
        }
        .row .spec {
          grid-column: 2;
          margin-top: -12px;
        }
        .metrics,
        .components,
        .guides {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
          gap: 32px;
        }
        footer {
          flex-direction: column;
        }
      }
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        html {
          scroll-behavior: auto;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <nav class="nav">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="nav-left">
          <a class="brand" href="#top"
            >Together AI</a
          ><span class="tag">Design system</span>
        </div>
        <div class="links">
          <a href="#colors">Colors</a><a href="#type">Type</a
          ><a href="#shape">Spacing</a><a href="#components">Components</a>
        </div>
        <a
          class="url"
          href="#"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >Site &nearr;</a
        >
      </div>
    </nav>
    <main id="top">
      <header class="hero">
        <div class="wrap">
          <h1>Infrastructure for the era of open models.</h1>
          <p>
            Near-black technical surfaces meet a single
            orange&ndash;magenta&ndash;periwinkle brand gesture.
          </p>
          <div class="buttons">
            <button class="btn">START BUILDING</button
            ><button class="btn mint">VIEW MODELS</button>
          </div>
          <div class="rail"></div>
        </div>
      </header>
      <div class="wrap site">
        <section id="colors">
          <div class="head">
            <h2>Colors</h2>
            <p>
              The spectrum remains one continuous gesture; the working interface
              is otherwise black, white and restrained gray.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="swatches">
            <div class="swatch" style="background: #010120; color: #fff">
              <b>Canvas dark</b><code>#010120</code>
            </div>
            <div class="swatch" style="background: #313641; color: #fff">
              <b>Dark soft</b><code>#313641</code>
            </div>
            <div class="swatch" style="background: #fc4c02">
              <b>Orange</b><code>#fc4c02</code>
            </div>
            <div class="swatch" style="background: #ef2cc1">
              <b>Magenta</b><code>#ef2cc1</code>
            </div>
            <div class="swatch" style="background: #bdbbff">
              <b>Periwinkle</b><code>#bdbbff</code>
            </div>
            <div class="swatch" style="background: #c8f6f9">
              <b>Mint</b><code>#c8f6f9</code>
            </div>
            <div class="swatch" style="background: #fff">
              <b>Canvas</b><code>#ffffff</code>
            </div>
            <div class="swatch" style="background: #000; color: #fff">
              <b>Ink</b><code>#000000</code>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section id="type">
          <div class="head">
            <h2>Two precise voices.</h2>
            <p>
              The Future sets display scale; PP Neue Montreal Mono labels
              controls and technical metadata.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="type">
            <div class="row">
              <span class="role">Display XXL</span
              ><span class="sample" style="font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 64px)"
                >A model-first future.</span
              ><span class="spec">64 / 70.4 / 500</span>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <span class="role">Display XL</span
              ><span class="sample" style="font-size: 40px"
                >Research at speed.</span
              ><span class="spec">40 / 48 / 500</span>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <span class="role">Body</span
              ><span style="font-size: 16px"
                >Clear infrastructure copy remains quietly functional.</span
              ><span class="spec">16 / 20.8 / 400</span>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <span class="role">Mono eyebrow</span
              ><span
                style="
                  font:
                    11px/1 ui-monospace,
                    monospace;
                  letter-spacing: 0.55px;
                "
                >SYSTEM / MODEL / ENDPOINT</span
              ><span class="spec">11 / 11 / 500</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section id="shape">
          <div class="head">
            <h2>Spacing &amp; shape</h2>
            <p>
              A comfortable 80px section rhythm with crisp 4px control geometry.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="metrics">
            <div class="spacing">
              <div class="space">
                <div class="bar" style="height: 2px"></div>
                <span>2</span>
              </div>
              <div class="space">
                <div class="bar" style="height: 8px"></div>
                <span>8</span>
              </div>
              <div class="space">
                <div class="bar" style="height: 16px"></div>
                <span>16</span>
              </div>
              <div class="space">
                <div class="bar" style="height: 32px"></div>
                <span>32</span>
              </div>
              <div class="space">
                <div class="bar" style="height: 48px"></div>
                <span>48</span>
              </div>
              <div class="space">
                <div class="bar" style="height: 80px"></div>
                <span>80</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="radii">
              <div class="radius" style="border-radius: 0">None<br />0px</div>
              <div class="radius" style="border-radius: 4px">
                Control<br />4px
              </div>
              <div class="radius" style="border-radius: 8px">
                Panel<br />8px
              </div>
              <div class="radius" style="border-radius: 9999px">
                Icon<br />full
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section>
          <div class="head">
            <h2>Dark infrastructure surface.</h2>
            <p>
              Dark bands contain model, endpoint and research material; the
              white canvas preserves the reading layer.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="dark-card">
            <div
              style="
                font:
                  11px ui-monospace,
                  monospace;
                letter-spacing: 0.55px;
                color: #c8f6f9;
              "
            >
              INFERENCE / CONFIG
            </div>
            <div class="code">
              model: deepseek-r1<br />endpoint: /v1/chat/completions<br />throughput:
              optimized
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section id="components">
          <div class="head">
            <h2>Components</h2>
            <p>
              Compact, square-edged controls keep technical hierarchy legible.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="components">
            <div>
              <h3 class="title">Actions</h3>
              <div class="buttons" style="margin-top: 16px">
                <button class="btn">RUN INFERENCE</button
                ><button class="btn mint">EXPLORE</button>
              </div>
              <p class="note">
                Mono-cap button labels, black primary action, mint secondary
                action, 4px radius.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
              <h3 class="title">Research card</h3>
              <p>
                White canvas, 4px radius and hairline border; use dark cards
                only where the content itself becomes the technical surface.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section id="guidelines">
          <div class="head"><h2>Hold the spectrum together.</h2></div>
          <div class="guides">
            <div>
              <h3>Do</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Use the three-color rail as one brand gesture.</li>
                <li>
                  Alternate dark infrastructure bands with white content bands.
                </li>
                <li>Pair display sans with mono metadata.</li>
                <li>Keep controls compact and square-edged.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>Avoid</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Splitting spectrum colors into unrelated accents.</li>
                <li>Heavy rounded consumer-app cards.</li>
                <li>Gray text on dark hero copy.</li>
                <li>Decoration that hides technical hierarchy.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <footer>
          <span>Together AI design system</span>
          <div class="downloads">
            <a href="#" download>DESIGN.md</a
            ><a href="#" download>tokens.json</a
            ><a href="#" download>variables.css</a
            ><a href="#" download>theme.css</a>
          </div>
        </footer>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
